        ecrm:P3_has_note    "British Galleries:\nThis style of woman's informal jacket was not meant to be worn in public.  For this reason such garments are never seen in portraits.  Its loose-fitting cut would have been particularly comfortable and the jacket may have been worn during pregnancy. [27/03/2003]"@en ;
